            "id": "730710130",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "And I've always been pretty good at taking care of plants, so finding a safe place to plant some Sweet Flowers or Mints to feed myself won't be a problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710131"
            ]
          },
          "730710131": {
            "id": "730710131",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Haha, a garden full of Sweet Flowers... Wouldn't that be paradise?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710132"
            ]
          },
          "730710132": {
            "id": "730710132",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What a sweet daydream she's having, eh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710133"
            ]
          },
          "730710133": {
            "id": "730710133",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Anyway, I am much happier now than when I was in Gandharva Ville, and I don't get beaten... I appreciate your kindness. But right now, it'd be for the best if you left me alone...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710134"
            ]
          },
          "730710134": {
            "id": "730710134",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... Paimon doesn't know what she's been through, but it seems like it would be hard to convince her to return.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710135"
            ]
          },
          "730710135": {
            "id": "730710135",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "To be fair, things don't look too dangerous around here... Let's come back and see her later if chance allows. Maybe she'll have changed her mind by then."
          },
          "730710110": {
            "id": "730710110",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes. So of course we got worried when we saw a little girl like you here all alone! We just can't leave you like this knowing that you might need help."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307102",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730710201"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730710201": {
            "id": "730710201",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "As long as there are seeds, I can grow more Sweet Flowers. But bread is different. You can't plant bread.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710202"
            ]
          },
          "730710202": {
            "id": "730710202",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "If bread could break in half and grow back again, no one would ever go hungry..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307103",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730710301"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730710301": {
            "id": "730710301",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hi Varsha! You're still here, huh?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710302"
            ]
          },
          "730710302": {
            "id": "730710302",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "#Paimon. {NICKNAME}. Good to see you. I'm doing well here. There's nothing for you to worry about.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710303"
            ]
          },
          "730710303": {
            "id": "730710303",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "You've persevered, huh...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710304"
            ]
          },
          "730710304": {
            "id": "730710304",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Are you still trying to persuade me? I'm not going anywhere with you. Not at all...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710305"
            ]
          },
          "730710305": {
            "id": "730710305",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well... we're not gonna force you to do anything. Remember what you said about \"a garden full of Sweet Flowers\"?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710306"
            ]
          },
          "730710306": {
            "id": "730710306",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Ah... It was a wishful thinking actually. I know there isn't such a place.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710307"
            ]
          },
          "730710307": {
            "id": "730710307",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Hmm... This maturity still feels weird coming from a kid.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710308"
            ]
          },
          "730710308": {
            "id": "730710308",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Guess what? We've got good news!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710309"
            ]
          },
          "730710309": {
            "id": "730710309",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "There really is a garden full of Sweet Flowers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710310"
            ]
          },
          "730710310": {
            "id": "730710310",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes! And believe it or not, the \"forest spirit\" that saved you is from a species called Aranara.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710311"
            ]
          },
          "730710311": {
            "id": "730710311",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "We know this, 'cause we've helped plant many Viparyas for them.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710312"
            ]
          },
          "730710312": {
            "id": "730710312",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We helped the earth to remember.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710313"
            ]
          },
          "730710313": {
            "id": "730710313",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "That's right. According to Aranakula, Vanarana remembers everything, so the Viparyas can sprout in the garden once the land remembers them again.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710314"
            ]
          },
          "730710314": {
            "id": "730710314",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "...I've heard a lot of stories like this before, and only kids take them seriously. But I know you said this with good intentions, Paimon, so thank you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710315"
            ]
          },
          "730710315": {
            "id": "730710315",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Aren't you a kid as well? And Paimon's not telling stories. Paimon means it for real!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710316"
            ]
          },
          "730710316": {
            "id": "730710316",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Yeah. That's what every storyteller says.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710317"
            ]
          },
          "730710317": {
            "id": "730710317",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "If you don't believe us... Well, seeing is believing! Come with us and see for yourself!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710318"
            ]
          },
          "730710318": {
            "id": "730710318",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Wait, you've really prepared a place to fit your story? Now I'm getting curious.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710319"
            ]
          },
          "730710319": {
            "id": "730710319",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh, Paimon's telling you the truth...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710320"
            ]
          },
          "730710320": {
            "id": "730710320",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "#Let's take her to the Aranara's garden, {NICKNAME}. That should silence her doubts once and for all."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7307104",
      "subQuestName": "Go to Vanarana's garden with Varsha",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "730710401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "730710401": {
            "id": "730710401",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "#Did you prepare all this, Paimon and {NICKNAME}?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710402"
            ]
          },
          "730710402": {
            "id": "730710402",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ugh... Yes and no. It's Aranakula and Arakara who tend to this garden together. We just helped out a little on the side. It is not built just for made-up stories.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710403"
            ]
          },
          "730710403": {
            "id": "730710403",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Aranakula and Arakara... They are the \"Aranara,\" the forest spirits?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710404"
            ]
          },
          "730710404": {
            "id": "730710404",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Yes! You finally believe Paimon now? Not only did we help to take care of the garden, but we also went on adventures with the Aranara!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710405"
            ]
          },
          "730710405": {
            "id": "730710405",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The Aranara are the ones who take the kidnapped kids back to Vimara Village.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710406"
            ]
          },
          "730710406": {
            "id": "730710406",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "It's still hard to believe the stories though... But if I stay here, will I have a chance to see them too?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710407"
            ]
          },
          "730710407": {
            "id": "730710407",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Vanarana is not actually dangerous, but are you sure you don't want to go back to Gandharva Ville?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710408"
            ]
          },
          "730710408": {
            "id": "730710408",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "You have a memory like a sieve, Paimon. I said I couldn't rely on adults and that I want to go my own way.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710409"
            ]
          },
          "730710409": {
            "id": "730710409",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "But...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710410"
            ]
          },
          "730710410": {
            "id": "730710410",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "Alright, don't worry about me. I've managed to live on my own so far, remember?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710411"
            ]
          },
          "730710411": {
            "id": "730710411",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "And I am a great caretaker of plants. The Aranara would be happy to see the garden flourishing here!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710412"
            ]
          },
          "730710412": {
            "id": "730710412",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, if you insist...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710413"
            ]
          },
          "730710413": {
            "id": "730710413",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "You're such a worrywart, Paimon. No one has cared about me this much for as long as I can remember.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710414"
            ]
          },
          "730710414": {
            "id": "730710414",
            "speakerId": 1001,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Uh... Listen here, Varsha, you are safe here in Vanarana. But you are still a kid, so please take care of yourself.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "730710415"
            ]
          },
          "730710415": {
            "id": "730710415",
            "speakerId": 1000,
            "speakerName": "Varsha",
            "text": "I know, I know. You two take care as well!"
          }
        }
      }
    },
